  "job_B1.3.30_20251001_193213": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00fea behet \u00feam halgan were \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde Cristen beon, gif se cnapa wurde hal. And Martinus sona si\u00f0ode to \u00feam wodan, and his hand him on asette, and gescynde \u00feone deofol fram Tetradius \u00f0a sona \u00fea he \u00fe\u00e6t geseah, gelyfde on urne Drihten, and let hine cristnian, and \u00e6fter lytlum ON \u00f0\u00e6re ylcan tide on \u00feam ylcan f\u00e6stene eode Martinus to anes mannes huse, \u00fea \u00e6tstod he f\u00e6rlice Martinus \u00fea het \u00feone hetolan deofol \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feanon gewite, and he wear\u00f0 \u00fea yrre gel\u00e6hte \u00e6nne mannan \u00dea fleah seo hiwr\u00e6den, and \u00fe\u00e6t folc eac swa. Ac Martinus eode \u00f0am wodan men togeanes het hine sona standan, and he stod \u00fea gynigende, and \u00dea dyde Martinus on mu\u00f0 \u00feam wodan his agenne fingras, and het hine fretan gif he \u00e6nige mihte \u00d0a adr\u00e6fde se halga wer \u00feone hetolan deofol of \u00feam gedrehton menn, ac he ne moste faran \u00feurh \u00feone Betwux \u00feam \u00fee se bisceop on \u00fe\u00e6re byrig wunode, \u00fea cydde man geond \u00fea burh \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r cuman wolde \u00dea wear\u00f0 eall seo burhwaru wundorlice afyrht for \u00fe\u00e6s heres ogan. \u00dea het Martinus sona him l\u00e6den to \u00e6nne wodne man, and he wear\u00f0 him to gel\u00e6d. Se halga wer \u00f0a het \u00feone wodan secgan gif hit so\u00f0 w\u00e6re be \u00f0am onsigendan here. \u00dea andette se deofol \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6s gedrehtan mu\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t sixtyne deofle w\u00e6ron \u00fee worh",
